## Product Mock-up

![](/images/experience/neardeal/image-9.webp)

## User Workflow

Even though “deal” makes a huge amount of the vision of our app. We still maintain a premium booking platform to match the beauty industry atmosphere. Each button, color, card and animation are crafted to excite user at the first touch. Meanwhile, frictionless design is implemented, like the three step “book first, pay later” approach, aims to increase customer conversion.

![](/images/experience/neardeal/image-10.webp)

![](/images/experience/neardeal/image-11.webp)

## Merchant Workflow

A dashboard design does not mean information should be complex and stuffed inside multiple panels. Clarity matters as most staff does not have a high computer literacy. We need to ensure the app can be self explorative with minimal training and error-free operation. I have carefully handpick the copy-writing and tested with real world user with multiple variations.

![](/images/experience/neardeal/image-12.webp)

## Staff Workflow

I need to ensure the staff app is has all the information at a glance and mistake-free design. Therefore, the home page of the app is distraction free with main action button and large text. Staff will confirm booking with a sliding gesture to prevent misclick.

![](/images/experience/neardeal/image-13.webp)
